      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "so whatever data is stored in day is data comes into our system thats\n\n30 TB / day   +   750 TB / day\n\n780 TB / day \n\nhence incoming data per second  =   780TB / 100 K    =    7.8 GB / s",
