    {
      "id": "Vs1a7Kbdbm3x8m78fD4t3",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 9338.778697113483,
      "y": 31872.94480331523,
      "width": 433.8597412109375,
      "height": 525,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "GxR6zJnwzm5c2qw9kgegv"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b06",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1939768171,
      "version": 137,
      "versionNonce": 821775269,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1776915698598,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2. Polling\n\nIdea\n    Client keeps asking:\n    “Do I have new messages?”\n\nServer replies:\n    Message → send it\n    No message → empty response\n\nProblems\n    Too many unnecessary requests\n    Wastes server resources\n    Delay in receiving messages\n    High load on system",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "2. Polling\n\nIdea\n    Client keeps asking:\n    “Do I have new messages?”\n\nServer replies:\n    Message → send it\n    No message → empty response\n\nProblems\n    Too many unnecessary requests\n    Wastes server resources\n    Delay in receiving messages\n    High load on system",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "59reImZoXs3JJD86HSyNK",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 9883.56354355497,
      "y": 31859.914392685634,
      "width": 697.2480159406531,
      "height": 545.6899305225813,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "9h8L3W2a7I6T96d_cR-BB"
