      "link": null,
      "locked": false
    },
    {
      "id": "Y8pbTZ-JotteLP94LXDpa",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 9914.49974650341,
      "y": 31887.75935790851,
      "width": 635.3756103515625,
      "height": 490,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "9h8L3W2a7I6T96d_cR-BB"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b06G",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 134028357,
      "version": 280,
      "versionNonce": 1082467659,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1776915795855,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "3. Long Polling\n\nIdea\n    Client asks once and waits:\n    “Do I have new messages?”\n\nServer replies\n    Message → send it immediately\n    No message → wait, then send empty (timeout)\n\nProblems\n    Connections stay open (heavy)\n    Still repeated requests after each response\n    Can timeout",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "3. Long Polling\n\nIdea\n    Client asks once and waits:\n    “Do I have new messages?”\n\nServer replies\n    Message → send it immediately\n    No message → wait, then send empty (timeout)\n\nProblems\n    Connections stay open (heavy)\n    Still repeated requests after each response\n    Can timeout",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "7eCwjdCwD1Zgl-l7meyjX",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 10650.892728994288,
      "y": 31859.91439271322,
      "width": 661.9548066661773,
      "height": 772.2806077772075,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
