    {
      "id": "J99F2jVPTGdm5ABw9h7OW",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 10682.242324809073,
      "y": 31878.55469737988,
      "width": 599.255615234375,
      "height": 735,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "czyXgTeMHYAWfv37oMy_o"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b07",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1875096043,
      "version": 221,
      "versionNonce": 1096117707,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1776915804532,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "4. WebSocket\n\nIdea\n    Keep connection open\n    Both client and server can send data anytime\n\nHow it starts\n    Client sends HTTP request with upgrade\n    Server replies: 101 Switching Protocols\n    Connection becomes WebSocket\n\nWorking\n    Max sends message → server\n    Server pushes message → Emily\n    No repeated requests\n\nBenefits\n    Real-time\n    Fast\n    Efficient\n    Two-way communication",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "4. WebSocket\n\nIdea\n    Keep connection open\n    Both client and server can send data anytime\n\nHow it starts\n    Client sends HTTP request with upgrade\n    Server replies: 101 Switching Protocols\n    Connection becomes WebSocket\n\nWorking\n    Max sends message → server\n    Server pushes message → Emily\n    No repeated requests\n\nBenefits\n    Real-time\n    Fast\n    Efficient\n    Two-way communication",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "hVibuRWXgr_0bEQL60AP2",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 8624.184115484377,
      "y": 31859.914392611558,
      "width": 603.6694777773318,
      "height": 543.302529999597,
