      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1776917856437,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "in case if message fails to send \nwhat we can do is .. we can use \nmessage queues + idempotency\n\nit should retry 3 5 times. and \nafter 5th failure enter that mess\nto DLQ and notify sender that \nmessage cant be sent\n\n\n\nand sometime during festivals\nwhen there is too much rush \nand lots of messages being sent\nwe can depriotize few messages\nlike wishes, thats what poeple\ndo during festivals or big event \nor so \n\nor in that case we can perform ok\ninstead of not performing at all\nand maintain our system health.",
      "fontSize": 69.72715605955149,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "in case if message fails to send \nwhat we can do is .. we can use \nmessage queues + idempotency\n\nit should retry 3 5 times. and \nafter 5th failure enter that mess\nto DLQ and notify sender that \nmessage cant be sent\n\n\n\nand sometime during festivals\nwhen there is too much rush \nand lots of messages being sent\nwe can depriotize few messages\nlike wishes, thats what poeple\ndo during festivals or big event \nor so \n\nor in that case we can perform ok\ninstead of not performing at all\nand maintain our system health.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
